 example, independent native review pending"},{"ja":"旅行のたびに、写真を撮ります。","reading":"りょこうのたびに、しゃしんをとります。","fr":"Je prends des photos à chaque voyage.","origin":"Original example, independent native review pending"}],"prerequisites":["grammar-relative-clause","grammar-verb-groups"],"sources":[{"url":"https://imabi.org/whenever-ii-%ef%bd%9e%e5%ba%a6%e3%81%ab-%ef%bd%9e%e9%83%bd%e5%ba%a6%e3%80%80-%ef%bd%9e%e3%81%ab%e3%81%a4%e3%81%91/","title":"Whenever II: ～度, ～都度, & ～につけ","publisher":"Seth Coonrod, original IMABI curriculum author","checkedAt":"12 October 2026","availability":"fetched","verification":"Source fetched; pedagogical source alignment reviewed editorially; no native review claimed","license":"Copyright retained by author; no open license verified","reuse":"Original paraphrase and examples; source lessons, recordings and illustrations not reproduced"}],"status":"editorial-draft","reviewScope":"Editorial linguistic review only; native-speaker review and learner testing pending","createdAt":"12 October 2026","learnerState":"not-assessed","oralPromptsFr":["Chaque fois que j’entends cette chanson, je repense au voyage.","Chaque fois que nous nous rencontrons, nous parlons japonais.","Je prends des photos à chaque voyage."],"levelEstimated":true,"origin":"/Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-zenray-japanese/research/language/LanguageAdvancedRecords.json","corpus":"language","recordShard":94,"revisionDate":"12 October 2026","markdown":"## adv-tabini : たびに : à chaque occurrence (12 October 2026)\n\nDomaine : grammar ; niveau : N3 ; statut : editorial-draft. (12 October 2026)\n\nVerbe de dictionnaire + たびに, ou nom + のたびに, présente une réponse répétée à un événement. (12 October 2026)\n\n| Japonais et lecture | Français |\n|---|---|\n| この歌を聞くたびに、旅行を思い出します。 (このうたをきくたびに、りょこうをおもいだします。) | Chaque fois que j’entends cette chanson, je repense au voyage. (12 October 2026) |\n| 会うたびに、日本語で話します。 (あうたびに、にほんごではなします。) | Chaque fois que nous nous rencontrons, nous parlons japonais. (12 October